 "23a49394-d14f-4445-af36-31cbad203a88")) (text "M = R1+R2+Rds(Q2) (Q2 on), H = R1+Rds(Q1) (Q1 on).  Logger: CTL_x HIGH = bypass FET ON. Defaults ON at reset." (at 20.32 160.02 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "90c393b2-3b3f-45ac-9bed-7277194c7d95")) (text "Route U1 IN+ / IN- as Kelvin traces: IN+ from J1 side of R1, IN- from the J2 side of R3. Keep R3/D1/D2/Q1/Q2 area clean (leakage!)." (at 20.32 165.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "bf1a1c80-69e8-41b8-af1e-7530f3e75f7e")) (text "R4/R5 must go to VIN (upstream of IN+), NOT to the FET source, otherwise their current is measured. VIN max ~6V (FET Vgs)." (at 20.32 170.18 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "8699efb4-5d17-4a3a-9524-0fd2e435d661")) (text "Calibrate each range with a known load; zero-calibrate range L with DUT disconnected (INA bias current, FET/diode leakage)." (at 20.32 175.26 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "05b51596-1292-4cb3-85b9-e03aea0cc275")) (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1"))))